    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d65">

                <pb facs="0074" n="62" xml:id="pg62"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">811.248/679: Telegram</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Minister in Afghanistan</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic">Engert</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic"
                        >to the Secretary of State
                    </hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Kabul</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1942-08-09T22:00:00+04:00">August 9, 1942—10
                            p.m.</date>
                        <lb/> [Received August 11—7:49 a.m.]</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>50. Regarding airplane incident. In a signed note the Minister of Foreign Affairs
                    now states <quote rend="blockquote">
                        <p>“Although the trespass committed by an American airplane over Afghan
                            territory has caused much concern to the Afghan Government the friendly
                            action of the American Legation and its assurance that the trespass was
                            not intentional have satisfied my Government and it accepts the
                            expression of regret of the United States Government.</p>
                        <p>Trusting that all necessary precautions will be taken by American
                            authorities concerned against the recurrence of such incidents in the
                            future I consider the matter as closed.”</p>
                    </quote>
                </p>
                <p>Repeated to Delhi.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Engert</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
